C03: an unobserved Windows version label is a composer defect (SYSTEM1305 residual H0508)

llm: invented_version in _payload_fact_defect when a system.status draft names a feature update («22H2») or a version number absent from the observed os facts; hint restricts the final to the observed edition, major version and build.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


